  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Balwan Singh Shreenandlal Chowdary vs State Of Mah. Thr. Pso Ps Wadki ... on 11 October, 2021 Author: Vinay Joshi Bench: V. G. Joshi Order 1 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Nagpur Bench : Nagpur. Criminal Application (Aba) No. 677/2021. Balwan singh Shreenandlal Chowdary. -Versus- State of Maharashtra, through P.S. Wadki, Tq. Ralegaon, District Yavatmal. Office Notes, Office Memoranda of Coram, Court's or J appearances, Court's orders of directions and Registrar's orders Shri S.A. Mohta, Advocate for the Applicant. Shri A. Chutke, A.P.P. for the Non-applicant. Coram : Vinay Joshi, J. Date : October 11, 2021 Heard. 2.",
    "facts": "In anticipation of arrest in Crime No.219/2021 registered with the non-applicant Wadki Police Station, Tq. Ralegaon, District Yavatmal for the offence punishable under Sections 272, 273, 328, 188, 269, 270 read with Section 34 of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 30[2][a], 26 and 29 of the Food and Safety Standard Act, the applicant is seeking pre-arrest protection. The applicant also seeks for ad-interim pre- arrest protection. 3. It is the prosecution case that on receipt of secret information, the police had intercepted a truck at Order 1110aba677.21 Yavatmal containing huge quantity of banned Gutka articles worth Rs.46 lakhs. The driver as well as the cleaner of the concerned truck came to be arrested on the spot. 4. The applicant is the registered owner of the said truck. It is submitted that the applicant has leased out the said truck for a period of one year under notarized lease deed dated 01.07.2021, to the driver of the truck namely Guddu. On the basis of said lease deed, the control of the truck was Balwan Singh Shreenandlal Chowdary vs State Of Mah. Thr. Pso Ps Wadki ... on 11 October, 2021 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/192254311/ 1 assigned to Guddu for a period of one year on contract, on paying Rs.30,000/- per month. On that basis, it is submitted that the applicant had no knowledge about the goods being transported by the truck, nor he has any sort of involvement in the alleged crime.",
